Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:30:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] - Power on: 0x41=0 -> 100ms -> 0x43=0 -> 100ms -> 0x43=1 -
 Power off: 0x41=0 -> 100ms -> 0x43=0 -> 100ms -> 0x41=1 -> wait 6s - Hard
 reset: write 0x14=1 - Power cycle: power off + 10s delay + power on - All
 CPLD operations serialized with mutex

Signed-off-by: liun <liun@yunsilicon.com>"
Signed-off-by: xliuning <IDLN@163.com>

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific]
